[49.783219, "o", "11: ## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing\r\n28: ## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing — field notes\r\n252: ## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n262: ## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence — field notes\r\n468: ## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing\r\n479: ## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing — field notes\r\n685: ## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n696: ## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — field notes\r\n828: ## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners\r\n838: ## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners — field notes\r\n1058: ## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output\r\n1069: ## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output — field notes\r\n1201: ## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n1213: ## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I) — field notes\r\n1419: ## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II) and Artifa"]
