[127.665663, "o", "## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n"]
[127.665814, "o", "\r\n"]
[127.665914, "o", "Extract policy (authoritative):\r\n"]
[127.665985, "o", "\r\n"]
[127.666064, "o", "Exception coding review: `exception_reason` is null unless a code applies. Set\r\n"]
[127.666141, "o", "`over_limit` when `amount_usd` strictly exceeds 10000. Set `compliance_hold`\r\n"]
[127.666216, "o", "when final status is `rejected`, a qualifying `compliance@` email referenced\r\n"]
[127.666291, "o", "that transaction, and that email block includes a `sent:` line. The sent-date\r\n"]
[127.666367, "o", "comparison used for `compliance_hold` is defined in Investigation Brief 09\r\n"]
[127.666443, "o", "(Mid-Year Amendment), not Brief 03. Multiple reasons join with semicolon in\r\n"]
[127.666538, "o", "lexical order of the reason codes.\r\n"]
